# AUDIT-092: developer/working-tree artifacts that must never land in the
# image. None are COPYed today, but the Dockerfile is free to broaden its
# COPY surface in a future PR — these lines keep that from silently shipping
# local debris, secrets-adjacent dumps, or the agent working files.
cookies.txt
interfaces.json
IRC-FORMAT.txt
node_modules/
tasks/
.claude/
lessons.md
*.csv
